+```sh
+forge test --match-contract UsdtYieldVaultMainnetForkFailureTest --match-test test_DepositWorksWithMainnetUsdtAndAave -vvv | sed -n '/UsdtYieldVault::deposit/,/Backtrace:/p'
+```
