+Suite result: FAILED. 0 passed; 1 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 1.68ms (318.74µs CPU time)
+
+Ran 1 test suite in 18.18ms (1.68ms CPU time): 0 tests passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped (1 total tests)
+
+Failing tests:
+Encountered 1 failing test in test/UsdtYieldVaultAccountingFailure.t.sol:UsdtYieldVaultAccountingFailureTest
+[FAIL: assertion failed: 1000000000 != 1003000000] test_WithdrawalFeesAccrueToRemainingShareholders() (gas: 346843)
+
+Encountered a total of 1 failing tests, 0 tests succeeded
+
+Tip: Run `forge test --rerun` to retry only the 1 failed test
