+
+Fix I would make: price shares from live vault custody, not a stored deposit counter. For Aave V3 this means using the current aUSDT balance, plus any idle USDT if withdrawals ever route through the vault. Add a fork or mock test that advances time/interest and asserts `balanceOfUnderlying` grows with the aToken balance.
+
